  "task": "marked-copy",
  "experiment": "corrected-dataset-fix (MCF1: dataset construction + audit)",
  "description": "Corrected marked-copy dataset preserving Butoi et al.'s mixed negative-generation strategy (50% uniform-random / 50% adversarial) but replacing the K-edit-perturbation adversarial half with an explicit hard-negative construction: a genuine positive w#w with two post-marker positions swapped -- preserving marker count/position, balanced halves, and the post-marker half's content multiset, breaking only the literal copy-content match. Same construction template as marked-reversal's F1, adapted for COPY instead of REVERSAL. Swap position randomized per-example (uniform within the half) to avoid concentrating the content-mismatch signal at any single index.",
